 MN {
  coords 328.325 24.509 5704.552
  m_sTitle "Mission notes"
  m_sTextData "<h2>End Conditions</h2>"\
  "<b>Iraq:</b>"\
  "Victory - Hold out for long enough to repel the Insurgent attack."\
  ""\
  "<b>Insuregents:</b>"\
  "Victory - OCCUPY the Iraqi checkpoint and ELIMINATE all garrisoning forces."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Restrictions</h2>"\
  "• Iraqi team is <b>forbidden</b> from digging trenches within the checkpoint."\
  "• Iraqi mortar team is <b>forbidden</b> from firing upon INDFOR spawn or within a 200m radius - If you know where it is."\
  ""\
  "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
  "• Setup timer: 1mins - Insurgents"\
  "• JIP: Manual | Deny after 8mins."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 10
 }
 SUM {
  coords 328.325 24.509 5704.552
  m_sTitle "Summary"
  m_sTextData "A major insurgent force is preparing to assault an Iraqi Army checkpoint south of Al-Hadra. The position controls a key stretch of highway that insurgent forces need secured in order to move men and equipment through the region freely."\
  "Outnumbered Iraqi defenders are expected to face a heavy attack as both sides fight for control of the route."\
  ""\
  "<b>Reference mission notes for restrictions</b>"\
  "• Setup timer: 1mins - Insurgents"
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
 }
}